  "slug": "lost-and-found-post-event-review-form",
  "title": "Lost and Found Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Review the lost-and-found program for a period: return rate, where items go missing, unclaimed disposition, and custody failures.",
  "description": "An original period review of a lost-and-found operation. It records the review scope and volumes, the return rate and how long returns take, the locations and event types that generate the most loss, the unclaimed disposition position, custody failures and their corrective actions, and the program changes carried forward.",
  "use_case": "Use at the end of a review period, or after a large event season, when the venue needs to know whether property actually gets back to guests and where losses concentrate. The review closes when every finding has an owner and program changes are recorded.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
