          "key": "performance_findings",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Performance findings",
          "items": [
            "Every found item was logged on the shift it was handed in",
            "Descriptions were detailed enough to match against lost reports",
            "Open lost reports were rechecked against new intake",
            "Guests were contacted proactively where the owner was identifiable",
            "Urgent items reached their owners the same day",
            "Shipping was offered and completed within the target window",
            "Holding periods were applied consistently across categories"
